          "type": "_item-faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it suitable for sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our formulas are thoughtfully developed with gentle, skin-friendly ingredients that are suitable for most skin types, including sensitive skin. If you have highly reactive skin or known allergies, we recommend performing a patch test before first use.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "item_faq_X4K6XP": {
          "type": "_item-faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I build a routine?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with the basics: cleanse, moisturize, and apply sunscreen in the morning; cleanse and apply a nourishing treatment at night. Once your skin adjusts, you can layer in a serum or targeted treatment based on your specific needs. Check out our Routine Guide for more detailed advice based on your skin type.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "item_faq_tg7yCc": {
          "type": "_item-faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are the ingredients natural?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our products prioritize naturally derived ingredients, carefully selected for both safety and effectiveness. Some formulas include science-backed actives to boost results, but always at gentle, skin-safe concentrations.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "item_faq_KBj4ra": {
          "type": "_item-faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I mix products together?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our products are designed to layer well together. That said, if you're using stronger actives like retinol or AHA/BHA, we recommend spacing out application times to avoid irritation.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "item_faq_PYdXYa": {
          "type": "_item-faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are your products cruelty-free?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. None of our products are tested on animals at any stage of development. We're committed to an ethical, environmentally conscious production process.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
